[00:00.00] 作词 : Andrew Hurley/Joe Trohman/Patrick Stump/Pete Wentz
[00:00.00][by:波罗猫与海鸥心]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Andrew Hurley/Joe Trohman/Patrick Stump/Pete Wentz
[00:02.68] An alligator prince with crocodile tears, too many to count
[00:02.68]鳄鱼界的王子 流着假惺惺的眼泪 数不胜数
[00:05.96] Permanent head cold dreams, awash in your love falling in and out
[00:05.96]垂下的头 冰冷的梦 在你的爱意中挣扎沉浮
[00:10.48] Time is luck and I wish ours overlapped more or for longer
[00:10.48]时间即是幸运 多么希望我们能够长久一些
[00:15.20] Orange leaves bore the ones falling off trees
[00:15.20]橙黄色的落叶挣脱树枝 飘落大地
[00:18.51] The first time I took the mask off, just had another one on underneath
[00:18.51]第一次摘掉伪装 新的面具却又浮现在我面前
[00:22.44] I'm just melted wax on a birthday cake
[00:22.44]我不过是融化在生日蛋糕上 惹人生厌的蜡滴
[00:25.22] Another year fades away
[00:25.22]又一年的岁月消逝而去
[00:27.05] Charcoal crushed, pixie fever, angel dust
[00:27.05]混沌中碰撞 狂热的精灵 天使身上的尘埃
[00:30.14] Stuck in a wasteland we covered in glitter and broadcast
[00:30.14]困在茫茫荒野 被闪光灯与采访声覆盖淹没
[00:33.04] Just for a little serotonin
[00:33.04]只需要一点点血清素
[00:34.86] Self-sabotage at best, under your spell
[00:34.86]在你的魔咒下 充其量是自我毁灭
[00:38.45] But you know what they say, if you want a job done right, you gotta do it yourself
[00:38.45]但你知道人们常说 若你想把工作做好 就必须凡事亲历亲为
[00:42.37] This palace was crystal, but the world was a cruel joke
[00:42.37]宫殿由水晶铸成 世界却充斥着残酷的笑话
[00:45.71] What is there between us, if not a little annihilation?
[00:45.71]若连那一丝湮灭都抛却 我们之间还剩什么?
